The '''Crait system''', also known as '''System PZ-43 Gamma''' was a [[star system]] located in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]] that contained the [[planet]] [[Crait]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> and the [[star]] of the [[Crait (star)|same name]].<ref name="Visual Dictionary" />

